WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:07.220
Absolutely crazy news broke yesterday, former
White House chief strategist to Donald Trump,

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:14.390
Steve Bannon, was arrested and indicted on
multiple charges for defrauding thousands

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:18.099
of donors through those crazy bill.

00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:22.609
We build the wall initiatives that he was
a part of.

00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:27.179
And it was Bannon and three other people indicted
in a federal investigation in the southern

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:28.939
district of New York.

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:35.350
What prosecutors say went down is that Bannon
and three others defrauded donors by raising

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:40.850
more than 25 million bucks to build a wall
along the southern border of the United States

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:45.870
and that a bunch of the money was used for
personal gain there.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.960
There are so many stories here.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:53.339
Remember when this was happening, when there
was this idea that, hey, if Trump can't get

00:00:53.339 --> 00:00:59.820
the money from the Libs or the Dems, then
we'll just raise the money privately.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.780
Turns out that Steve Bannon was involved in
one of those schemes at the time.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:09.670
I said, who's stupid enough to donate to this
to think that this is a project that individuals

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.320
can actually do?

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:16.291
And if they did donate to it, is it so stupid
that they deserve what's coming to them, which

00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:17.799
is to lose their money?

00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:19.490
But clearly, this is a scam.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.020
And we were right.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:29.280
But the scam is one that Steve Bannon is involved
in to the tune of 25 million dollars.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:34.979
The other people indicted in CRU include that
guy, Brian Cole Fidge, who's the guy we reported

00:01:34.979 --> 00:01:37.950
on when this money was actually being raised.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:42.560
And of course, now the distancing with Steve
Bannon by some will start.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.259
Trump, I'm sure, will say this is very unfair.

00:01:46.259 --> 00:01:49.640
These were people looking to do something
that the Dems didn't want to do.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:52.370
They were doing a good thing, raising money
for the wall, of course.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.329
That's not what's at what's at issue.

00:01:54.329 --> 00:02:01.930
What's at issue is that it is was allegedly
a money laundering wire fraud scheme.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:06.560
And there was this funny picture over the
weekend of Steve Bannon being interviewed

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.849
on Fox News and looking really haggard.

00:02:08.849 --> 00:02:12.480
And a lot of people were laughing about it
and commenting on it.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.470
Maybe he knew this was coming and that's why
his appearance was so bizarre and outrageous.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.760
And federal prosecutors have a lot of details
here.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:26.020
They say that when donors were donating to
this project, they were assured 100 percent

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.210
of the money raised will go to build the wall.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:31.650
And I could tell that wasn't true.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.720
Many of you could tell that wasn't true.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:39.780
Anybody with any common sense could tell they're
not using 25 million to build the wall.

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:46.040
People started writing to Brian Cole Fidge
and then it started to get weird.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:53.030
And then it turns out that these guys were
profiting from this, profiting from an attack.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:57.950
And again, I sort of said, if you donate to
this, you're so stupid, you deserve to lose

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:58.970
your money.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.340
Still, criminal criminality is alleged here.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:05.490
And so if there are criminals and they can
be proven to be criminals, they should be

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.840
prosecuted.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:11.250
Morally, maybe there's a different argument
to be made, but certainly there should be

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.550
prosecution.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:18.260
And we're talking about these individuals
taking hundreds of thousands of dollars from

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:24.720
the donations, essentially creating really
like their own slush fund, in a sense.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:30.260
And now the PR will start and now we are going
to see this turned into yet another one of

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:35.390
these political witch hunts, as many claim
that the Trump investigations have been in

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:37.200
the Trump impeachment have been.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.549
But don't be confused.

00:03:38.549 --> 00:03:43.080
If it smells like a duck and it walks like
a duck and it sounds like a duck.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:47.430
It's often a duck or someone pretending to
be a duck.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:53.629
And in this case, this was all of the above
and more to sort of go to the end of the analogies

00:03:53.629 --> 00:03:54.629
and metaphors.

00:03:54.629 --> 00:03:57.510
But is anybody, if anybody, is truly surprised
by this?

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.150
I would be shocked.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:00.150
But that's the latest.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.340
Steve Bannon indicted.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:03.570
Are we going to hear Bannon?

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.329
I don't remember Bannon.

00:04:05.329 --> 00:04:08.549
Was he like an intern maybe for a brief period
in 2015?

00:04:08.549 --> 00:04:09.549
No.

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:13.239
This guy was on the National Security Council
at one point, or at least he sat in the meetings.

00:04:13.239 --> 00:04:31.680
This is serious and they're going to pretend

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:48.640
it's not.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:05:12.890
But

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:29.180
this

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:58.470
is absolutely outrageous.

